msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:125
#: 6ed78258de144a169d29d0e608f37dd2
msgid "Optionally increase :ref:`VISO_QUAL_MIN <VISO_QUAL_MIN>` to 10 (or higher) to only consume estimates from the camera when the quality is 10% (or higher)"
